	"sup_title": "Support",
	"sup_subtitle": "Help & Frequently Asked Questions",
	"sup_contact": "Contact Us",
	"sup_contact_desc": "We usually reply within 1–2 working days.",
	"sup_faq_heading": "Frequently Asked Questions",
	"sup_faq1_q": "How do I start an assessment?",
	"sup_faq1_a": "Open your Dashboard and click “Start Assessment”. If a teacher sent you an invite, the child's name is filled in automatically — you only add age and gender, then play through the six short activities.",
	"sup_faq2_q": "Who decides my child's condition?",
	"sup_faq2_a": "No one picks it manually. The condition is determined automatically from the assessment report once the activities are completed, and shown on your dashboard as detected areas.",
	"sup_faq3_q": "How do I get a specialist to review the report?",
	"sup_faq3_a": "On your Dashboard, open “Specialist Support” and send a request to a registered doctor or psychologist. You'll see the status (pending / accepted) update there.",
	"sup_faq4_q": "Is my child's data private?",
	"sup_faq4_a": "Assessment data is linked only to your account and the teacher/specialist you're connected to. Reports and media are stored securely and are never shared publicly.",
	"sup_faq5_q": "Does it work without internet?",
	"sup_faq5_a": "The app is installable and previously-opened pages load offline. Assessment answers are captured on the device and sync to the server automatically when the connection returns.",
